      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For over-the-counter pain relief, it's generally safe to take up to 1,000 mg of Tylenol (acetaminophen) every 4 to 6 hours, not exceeding 3,000 mg in a single day. However, it's crucial to follow the guidelines on the bottle. Since you're looking for relief, it might help merging Tylenol with a nap or a compression garment for your legs. Consult a healthcare professional if the pain persists. Rest well!",
