      "content": "Wait, you just said Tylenol with Codeine... i actually have some old prescription Tylenol #3 left over from a dental thing a few months ago. if i take that with the regular Tylenol to make sure the pain is actually managed, is that okay? i dont want to mix things up and cause a reaction but i feel like i need both to really get some sleep tonight.",
